<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of games played in the Spanish first division on Saturday.</p>
<p>Real Betis 1 (Pier Cherubino 21st minute) Espanyol 2 (Miguel Angel Benitez 18th, Jordi Lardin 45th, pen). Half-time 1-2. Attendance 42,000.</p>
<p>Sporting Gijon 0 Atletico Madrid 1 (Roberto Fresnedoso 78th). 0-0. 22,000.</p>
<p>Real Madrid 0 Tenerife 0. 85,000.</p>
<p>Barcelona 3 (Ronaldo 15th, 35th, 74th) Valencia 2 (Francisco Ferreira 52nd, Valery Karpin 58th). 2-0. 108,000.</p>
</text>
